<title>USA: Southwest Air to expand headquarters.</title>
<headline>Southwest Air to expand headquarters.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Airlines Co said Wednesday it will spend $30 million to expand its corporate headquarters in Dallas.</p>
<p>The airline said it will begin construction on a 300,000-square-foot addition to its exisiting corporate headquarters.</p>
<p>Southwest said it will add 1,500 new Dallas-based jobs over the next eight years, starting in the fall of 1997.</p>
